          'Top-tier restaurants install commercial multi-stage Reverse Osmosis (RO) water purification units integrated with Ultraviolet (UV) disinfection. These systems supply all kitchen prep water, cooking broths, and automatic ice makers, ensuring that beverages and raw salad washes are completely free from municipal pipe contaminants.',
